<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="heading">测评成绩趋势</text><text>按有效提交时刻排列，班级取完整评分中的最晚提交；未完整评分按可用提交或截止时刻排列。每条只与紧邻前次比较。</text><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核对此快照</button><button bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">返回当前班级报告</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}<button bindtap="login">核对身份</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{head}}">
    <view class="card"><text class="heading">{{student ? student.name : '班级完整确认评分均分'}}</text><text wx:if="{{student}}">账号 {{student.account}}</text><text>{{head.className}} · {{head.subject}} · {{head.book}}</text><text>{{head.from}} 至 {{head.to}}</text><text>快照第 {{head.snapshotGeneration}} 代 · {{head.calculated}}</text><text class="muted">{{comparisonVersion}}</text><text>均分仅包含完整确认评分。真实零分计入，缺失不计零分；教师可见评分不等于已向学生发布。分数变化不表示教学干预效果。</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><text class="heading">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.at}} · 冻结试卷版本 {{item.version}} · {{item.questions}} 题</text><text>{{item.score}} / {{item.max}}<text wx:if="{{item.percent !== null}}"> · {{item.percent}}%</text></text><view wx:if="{{item.percent !== null}}" class="trend-bar" aria-hidden="true"><view class="trend-bar-value" style="width: {{item.percent}}%;"></view></view><text>原固定分配 {{item.original}} 人；当前纳入 {{item.included}} 人；完整确认评分 {{item.scoredCount}} 人</text><text>待批改 {{item.pendingGradingCount}} · 缺考 {{item.absentCount}} · 未开始 {{item.notStartedCount}}</text><text>作答中 {{item.inProgressCount}} · 待封存 {{item.awaitingSealCount}} · 窗口外提交 {{item.outsideWindowCount}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.comparison}}</text><button wx:if="{{student}}" bindtap="basis" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看本次测评知识点依据</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!rows.length && !busy}}" class="card">此范围没有测评记录。</view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页测评</button><text>{{offset + rows.length}} / {{total}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页测评</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
